  "account": "破局书屋",
  "source_title": "人一旦看过《隐形的契约》搞钱就像开了上帝视角！#赚钱思维",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 99.170975,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "记住，不要做生意，要做资产生意，做的是利润越做越累，而资产做的是现就流越做越稳。老板的尽头是收支，创业的尽头是自由，要想实现财富自由，只有三条路径，要么靠人力杠杆，让一群人帮你赚钱，要么靠资本杠杆，让你的钱自动生钱，要么靠资产杠杆，让你手里的动产和不动产收租赚钱。缺少了这三样，那你只能用体力和时间来换酬劳，本质就是拿命运换钱。你以后多看看这本隐形的契约，很多认知和赚钱思维都是来源于这本书。你看这社会多奇怪，好多人不上班，但是日子过得挺好，哪来的钱呢？有些人天天上班，反而没有钱。后来看完这本书才发现，原来秘密都在这本书里，叫做隐形的契约。如果你想了解更多赚钱思路，那你熬夜也要看完这本书，它就是一本赚钱秘籍。读完后惊出一身冷汗，会发现自己以前的思维认知就像被带上了枷锁。而每翻开一页，都像是打开了一扇心窗，勤劳能致富吗？外卖小哥凌晨三四点下班也赚不到一万块，靠打工发不了财。书中教的全是互利社交的方法和商业法则，帮你打破社交误区，拆解关系核心，掌握相处方法，讲透社会运行的底层逻辑，用反向思维思考问题。这本书拿到以后，你不管送给谁，都会感谢你一辈子。年轻人现在读少走十年冤枉路，四十岁以后读可能迎来人生巅峰。所以不管你是三十岁、四十岁还是五十岁，这本隐形的契约，你一定要带回去认真看今天这本书，我放在左下角了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1150,
      "end_ms": 2010,
      "text": "不要做生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2350,
      "end_ms": 3930,
      "text": "要做资产生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3930,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "做的是利润越做越累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5730,
      "end_ms": 8070,
      "text": "而资产做的是现就流越做越稳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8450,
      "end_ms": 9810,
      "text": "老板的尽头是收支，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10070,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "创业的尽头是自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11510,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "要想实现财富自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13030,
      "end_ms": 14110,
      "text": "只有三条路径，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14470,
      "end_ms": 15730,
      "text": "要么靠人力杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15830,
      "end_ms": 17090,
      "text": "让一群人帮你赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17390,
      "end_ms": 18590,
      "text": "要么靠资本杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 18830,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "让你的钱自动生钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20590,
      "end_ms": 21770,
      "text": "要么靠资产杠杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22110,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "让你手里的动产和不动产收租赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 24890,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "text": "缺少了这三样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 26150,
      "end_ms": 28370,
      "text": "那你只能用体力和时间来换酬劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 28370,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "本质就是拿命运换钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "你以后多看看这本隐形的契约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33520,
      "end_ms": 36220,
      "text": "很多认知和赚钱思维都是来源于这本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36360,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "text": "你看这社会多奇怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 38100,
      "end_ms": 39080,
      "text": "好多人不上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39180,
      "end_ms": 40280,
      "text": "但是日子过得挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40420,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "哪来的钱呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 41660,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "有些人天天上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 42820,
      "end_ms": 43540,
      "text": "反而没有钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 43960,
      "end_ms": 45360,
      "text": "后来看完这本书才发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 45560,
      "end_ms": 47100,
      "text": "原来秘密都在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 47400,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "叫做隐形的契约。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 48900,
      "end_ms": 50820,
      "text": "如果你想了解更多赚钱思路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 51000,
      "end_ms": 52600,
      "text": "那你熬夜也要看完这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 52940,
      "end_ms": 54340,
      "text": "它就是一本赚钱秘籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 54540,
      "end_ms": 56200,
      "text": "读完后惊出一身冷汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 56540,
      "end_ms": 59795,
      "text": "会发现自己以前的思维认知就像被带上了枷锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 60270,
      "end_ms": 61295,
      "text": "而每翻开一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61520,
      "end_ms": 63060,
      "text": "都像是打开了一扇心窗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 63260,
      "end_ms": 64440,
      "text": "勤劳能致富吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 64720,
      "end_ms": 68620,
      "text": "外卖小哥凌晨三四点下班也赚不到一万块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 68840,
      "end_ms": 70060,
      "text": "靠打工发不了财。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70300,
      "end_ms": 73280,
      "text": "书中教的全是互利社交的方法和商业法则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 73480,
      "end_ms": 74780,
      "text": "帮你打破社交误区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 74960,
      "end_ms": 76020,
      "text": "拆解关系核心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 76200,
      "end_ms": 77220,
      "text": "掌握相处方法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 77460,
      "end_ms": 79435,
      "text": "讲透社会运行的底层逻辑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 79730,
      "end_ms": 81230,
      "text": "用反向思维思考问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 81330,
      "end_ms": 82370,
      "text": "这本书拿到以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82370,
      "end_ms": 83310,
      "text": "你不管送给谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 83450,
      "end_ms": 84635,
      "text": "都会感谢你一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 84930,
      "end_ms": 87185,
      "text": "年轻人现在读少走十年冤枉路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87480,
      "end_ms": 90035,
      "text": "四十岁以后读可能迎来人生巅峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 90510,
      "end_ms": 93325,
      "text": "所以不管你是三十岁、四十岁还是五十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 93740,
      "end_ms": 94860,
      "text": "这本隐形的契约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 95100,
      "end_ms": 98020,
      "text": "你一定要带回去认真看今天这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_734ec81ff3d7343f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 98020,
      "end_ms": 99025,
      "text": "我放在左下角了。"
    }
  ],
